2 DATE ABT 1642
2 ADDR
3 CITY Uppsala
3 STAE Uppland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 20 NOV 1700
2 ADDR
3 CITY Narva
3 STAE Ida-Viru County
3 CTRY Estonia
