2 GIVN Per Carlsson
2 SURN Ribbing
2 _MARNM Ribbing
1 NAME Per Ribbing
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 14 NOV 1740
2 PLAC Ulvsnäs
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Öggestorp
3 CITY Jönköping
3 STAE Småland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 APR 1790
2 ADDR
