2 CONC s of Elibank, reference GD32/19/9]
2 CONT ** 22 December 1596: Copy tack by Mr James Logane [Logan] in favour of Alexander Lauder of Haltoun [Halton] and Marie Maitland his spouse of the teinds of Eister [Easter] and Wester Wormiestoun [Wormiston], also called Cringiltie 
