1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Maria Persdotter (Svan)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Per Ulfsson Svahn and Judith Johansdotter Bökman
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Svansk%C3%B6ld_nr_1264 Noble family Svansköld no. 1264 †, by adelsvapen Geneologies]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Noble family Svansköld no. 1264 †
2 CONT
2 CONT Ennobled 1693-06-17. Extinct 1709.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham Winandts , born in Amsterdam. Traded in Stockholm. Died 1644 in Stockholm. '''Married in Stockholm 1642-09-14 to Maria Persdotter (Svan) in her 1st marriage, daughter of the mayor of Västerås Per Ulfsson Svan and his 3rd w
2 CONC ife Judit Johansdotter Bökman .'''
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=  
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Abraham Winandts,''' ennobled Svansköld, born 1644 in Stockholm. Employed at the cathedral building in Kalmar and the castle building in Stockholm. Ennobled 1693-06-17. Died unmarried 1709 at Boo in Värmdö parish.
