1 NAME Carl Sperling /Staël von Holstein/
2 GIVN Carl Sperling
2 _MARNM Staël von Holstein
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 26 APR 1773
2 PLAC Vapnö
2 ADDR
3 STAE Hallands län
