1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Clerck_nr_433 '''William Clerck'''], född i Skottland. Inkom till Sverige såsom kapten vid ett värvat skotskt regemente. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Död 1625'''-02-11. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift''' med '''Malin Duncan''', dotter av kaptenen '''William Duncan''', som inkommit från Skottland, och '''Catharina Jemse of Wedderburn'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT William Clerck arrived in Sweden. Married Malin Duncan. Malin? Daughter of "Catherine Jemse of Wedderburn Duncan". There's a Wedderburn castle in Scotland built later, or incorporated to something owned by the Nisbet family before
2 CONC . https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wedderburn_Castle Jemse? One way to look at it could be Ramsay which in Swedish could resemble "Remse". 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Kapten
