2 CONC e%26hl%3Den%26safe%3Doff%26client%3Dsafari%26rls%3Den%26prmd%3Divnso Swedish nobility naturalization as de Frese] on 16 June 1731 and entry at the nobility class of the Swedish knighthood in 1731 for the Royal Swedish Lieutenant G
2 CONC eorg Christian Frese at the number 1856th"
