1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=3&id=200251570974&active=4 EAA.858.2.592]: Leutnant Hans von Drenteln, wegen seiner seeligen Ehefrau, der Tochter des seeligen Daniel Falck (Falkenklau) zu Kurtna
2 CONC , Ontika, Roxefer (Raustfer? Konju, Jõhvi), Klein Sack (Hof?) und Amfär (Ampfer Auvere, Vaivara)) contra Kapitän Daniel Falkenklau als Verkäufer und Kapitän Otto Knorring zu Ontika resp Casper Rodde, als Käufer des Gutes Ontika be
2 CONC treffend Retract des Falckschen Erbguts Ontika (Jewe Jõhvi)
2 CONT === ===
2 CONT -----
2 CONT https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=3&id=200251570974&active=4
2 CONT EAA.858.2.592: Lieutenant Hans von Drenteln, because of his blessed wife, the '''daughter of the blessed Daniel Falck (Falkenklau)''' zu Kurtna, Ontika, Roxefer (Raustfer? Konju, Jõhvi), Klein Sack (Hof?) and Amfär (Ampfer Auvere 
2 CONC , Vaivara)) contra Captain Daniel Falkenklau as seller and Captain Otto Knorring to Ontika resp. Casper Rodde, as buyer of the Ontika estate regarding retract of the Falck inheritance Ontika (Jewe Jõhvi)
2 CONT -----
2 CONT https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daniel_Simonsson_Falck
2 CONT '''"daughter, was married to Öötla landowner , lieutenant Hans von Drenteln"'''
2 CONT -----
2 CONT -----
2 CONT '''Conflicting sources, who were her parents?'''
2 CONT '''It seems all the big main sources are wrong on her parents, see below:'''
2 CONT -----
2 CONT Genealogisches Handbuch:
2 CONT https://personen.digitale-sammlungen.de/baltlex/Blatt_bsb00000601,00373.html?prozent=
2 CONT '''"NN Falk buried Narwa 1695, daughter of Anton,'''"
2 CONT -buried 1695 is wrong
2 CONT -----
2 CONT Schlegel/Klingspor "Ej introducerade adeln":
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000191319995959
2 CONT Falk, Falkenklou
2 CONT '''daughter of Anton'''
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?id=MoEn2z_bUBkC&pg=PA72&dq=Drenteln+Falk&hl=en&ei=5PR7TaPVHMzr4gaFncC4BQ&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=2&ved=0CC0Q6AEwAQ#v=onepage&q=Drenteln%20Falk&f=false
2 CONT -----
2 CONT Elgenstierna 1925-36:
2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Von_Drenteln_nr_1784
2 CONT Hans von Drenteln, till Oethell i Emmerns socken i Estland. Löjtnant vid estländska adelsfanan. Död 1705. Gift 1:o med N. N. Falkenklo i hennes 2:a gifte (gift 1:o med Daniel Slacken),''' dotter av inspektören över stora sjötullen
2 CONC  i Reval Anton Falk, adlad Falkenklo, men ej introducerad, till Ampfer i Estland.''' Gift 2:o 1695-11-28 med Margareta Elisabet von Engelhardt. (Riga)
2 CONT -----
2 CONT Szabad 2008 only has this on Drenteln, '''no new info on the wife NN. Falkenklou''':
2 CONT
2 CONT VON DRENTELN adl. ätten nr 1784 TAB. 1.
2 CONT Hans von Drenteln, g. 2:o i Kirschspiel, St Johannis, Livland m. Margareta Elisabet von Engelhardt,
2 CONT dotter till Mikael von Engelhard, nr 1858 och Dorotea von Buttlar (ej Anna Dorotea Buttler).
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Helena, † 23/10 (ej 28/10). 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Sources: EÄ:II s325; GHdA:1967: band39 s182; Mörner s105)
2 CONT -----
2 CONT GHdA, Genealogisches Handbuch des Adels:
2 CONT Since Szabad lists GHdA as a source we have to '''assume it also has Anton as the father'''?
2 CONT If GHdA had Daniel as father Szabad would have said so or not listed GHdA as source?
2 CONT I will check GHdA anyway. /D Bruno jan 2023
2 CONT ----
