1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Well known genealogical compilations by Anrep, Elgenstierna and Stackelberg all seem to be in error when it comes to parents of Hans von Drenteln. 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Stackelberg, Hans von Drenteln was a son of Carsten von Drenteln and Elisabeth Römer, which cannot be true due to the birth year of his alleged mother (1628). 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Elgenstierna, Hans von Drenteln was a son of ''borgmästare'' Herman Gotthard von Drenteln and Elisabeth Koch. This seems to be partially correct, as Johann Mohrenschildt, brother of Elisabeth Koch, was named multiple 
2 CONC times as a maternal uncle (''Ohm'') of Hans von Drenteln in [https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127104646295801&kokku=1&id=200704761122 a document from 1667]. On the other hand, Hermann Gotthard von 
2 CONC Drenteln seems to be a fictitious person - there was no such ''borgmästare'' of Tallinn and there doesn't seem to have existed such a family member at all.
2 CONT
2 CONT The most likely version seems to be that Hans von Drenteln was a son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Heinrich-von-Drenteln/6000000011238565643?through=6000000053036531830 Heinrich von Drenteln] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Eli
2 CONC sabeth-Koch/6000000011238830675 Elisabeth Koch]. Heinrich von Drenteln (buried in 1651) was merchant in Tallinn and a younger brother of [https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Benjamin-von-Drenteln/6000000005563120617?through=6000000
2 CONC 007474038880 Thomas von Drenteln]. To support this theory, there is a [https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.325:25 document of him] from 03.01.1653, where he mentions that his father is already dead by this time. This also 
2 CONC very surely excludes Carsten and Thomas von Drentlen as his possible fathers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contrary to his ancestors, Hans von Drenteln was not a citizen of Tallinn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Further research is needed to confirm his ancestry with 100% certainity, but already with current proof, we can be very sure that the theory about Heinrich von Drenteln and Elisabeth Koch is correct.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Military career===
2 CONT *corporal (earliest mention 03.02.1664)
2 CONT *lieutenant (earliest mention 1676)
2 CONT *By 06.09.1690 he was not in active military service any more
2 CONT
2 CONT ===1650s===
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.325:25 03.01.1653] - Earliest mention of him. Loan agreement between Hans von Drenteln and [https://www.geni.com/people/Gehrt-Witte/6000000118637111903?through=6000000017894374076 Gerd
2 CONC t Witte] and his children. Hans von Drenteln mentions that his father is already dead by this time. Also mentioned is [https://www.geni.com/people/Metta-Br%C3%BCggemann/6000000008539017031?through=6000000011238830675 Metta Brügema
2 CONC nn] (Grossmutter die Kochsche), but I do not understand if she is given as the grandmother of Hans or the daughters of Gerdt Witte.
2 CONT *[13.05.1653] - Something in connection with debt dispute with Merchant Johann Viandt
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.448:89 23.08.1655] - first mention of his marriage to Maria Falckenklau
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127122457403220&kokku=1&id=200704678476 15.08.1657] - 21 Kapten Hans Lindemanni, Hans Drentelni ja kortermeister Jacob Weieri kaasavaranõuded Anton Falckenklault
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127110615426814&kokku=6&id=200704739446 03.03.1658] - 15 Hans Lindtman, Jacob Weier ja Hans von Drenteln Narvast oma abikaasade venna Anton Falkenklau vastu seose
2 CONC s pärandi jagamisega
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127110615426814&kokku=6&id=200704739446 16.03.1658] - 24 Major Hans Lindtman, Hans von Drenteln ja Jacob Weyer oma abikaasade vendade Falckenklaude vastu seoses p
2 CONC ärandi jagamisega
2 CONT ===1660s===
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127110615426814&kokku=6&id=200704748508 05.08.1661] - 69 Daniel Falckenklau, Hans Lindeman ja Hans von Drenteln rittmeister Leslie vastu seoses nõudega tagastada 
2 CONC Ontika mõis
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.325:23 03.02.1664] - 18 Kornet Johan Ertmani immissiooninõue kapral Hans von Drentelni Auvere mõisast
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.330:63 14.12.1666] - 33 Jacob Klanderi võlanõue Hans von Dräntellilt (Drenteln)
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127110615426814&kokku=6&id=200704761122 11.01.1667] - 25 Hans von Drenteln oma onu Johan Mohrenschildi vastu seoses Samuel Ackerbohmile võla tasumisega
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127123031849231&kokku=4&id=200704764462&f=1 04.02.1667] - 1 Johan Mohrenschildti vastuskiri Hans von Drentelni supliigile seoses Bernd Mohrenschildti pärandiga
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127123031849231&kokku=4&id=200704765732 15.03.1667] - 39 Johan Mohrenschildti vastuskiri Hans von Drentelni võlanõudele
2 CONT ===1670s===
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230201113103825258&kokku=21&id=200704782868 22.02.1671] - 103 Pastor Bartholduse lese Anna Jonstochteri immissiooninõue Hans von Drentelni Auvere mõisast
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230131202536782937&kokku=1&id=200251578985 13.02.1672] - Seeligen Daniel Falckenklaus sämtlichen Erben, seine Schwiegersöhne, Jacob Weyer, Jonas Besk (?), Hans von D
2 CONC renteln und Major Lindemann und seine vier Töchter Elisabeth, Margaretha, Maria und Christina contra den Narwschen Bürger und Kaufmann Caspar Rodde Pfandhalter der Falckenklauschen Güter Kurtna (Kurtna, Jõhvi) und Ontika (Ontika, 
2 CONC Jõhvi) betreffend Vorzugsrecht der Mitgabenforderung der Töchter vor dem Pfandrecht des Beklagten
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230131114215835737&kokku=15&id=200000396494 1676] - Akte in Beschwerdesachen des Leutnants Hans von Drenteln wider die Gebrüder Falckenau wegen Verkaufs der geerbten
2 CONC  Gründe und Boden. Genannt sind die Hausplätze in Narva, die Güter Ampfer, Kurtna und Entika (Ontika)
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230201113103825258&kokku=21&id=200704671790 22.05.1678] - 125 Jürgen Heidemani lese Anna Elisabeth von Tiesenhauseni vastuskiri Hans von Drentelni võlanõudele
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230201113103825258&kokku=21&id=200704672197 08.06.1678] - 16 Jürgen Heidemani lese Anna Elisabeth von Tiesenhauseni vastuskiri leitnant Hans von Drentelni võlanõudel
2 CONC e
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=AM.301.1.6:2 13.06.1678] - Tallinn. Gustav von Lode pandib Järvamaal Peetri kihelkonnas asuva Öötla mõisa 3 aastaks leitnant Hans von Drentelnile.
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230201113103825258&kokku=21&id=200704854665 06.12.1679] - 59 Otto von Knorringi lesk Margareta von Vietinghoff palvega lükata seoses tütre läheneva pulmaga Ülemmaako
2 CONC htu istung leitnant Hans von Drentelni nõude arutlusega edasi
2 CONT ===1680s===
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.426:41 12.03.1683] - 13 Major Hans Rammi lesk Catharina Falckenklau leitnant Hans von Drentelni vastu nõudega üle anda rendil olnud talu
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.427:213 21.05.1683] - 65 Hans Rammi lesk Catharina Falckenklau oma õemehe leitnant Hans von Drentelni vastu nõudega üle anda pool adramaad Auvere külast
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.437:78 10.07.1684] - 31 Otto Jürgen Sassi lesk Dorothea von Luhren immissiooninõudega leitnant Hans Drentelni Öötla pandimõisast
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230131124106313859&kokku=2&id=200704983184 22.07.1684] - ]78 Leitnant Hans von Drenteln vastusega Otto Jürgen Sassi lese Dorothea von Luhri supliigile seoses Auvere 
2 CONC mõisa rendilepingu rikkumisega. This document contains proof that Hans von Drenteln was the father of Heinrich Johann von Drenteln: "''mein Sohn, herr Lieutenant Heinrich Johann von Drenteln''"
2 CONT *[https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.443:75 07.03.1685] - 23 Lipnik Jonas Besche lesk Margaretha Falckenklau leitnant Hans von Drentelni vastu seoses tollivilja võlaga riigile
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230127112231668002&kokku=20&id=200705109436 14.03.1687] - 95 Öötla pandipidaja Hans von Drenteln palvega anda talle pikendust raehärra Dietrich Hetlingi pärijatele v
2 CONC õlgade tasumisel. [https://www.ra.ee/dgs/_purl.php?shc=EAA.1.2.466:287 '*Wegen meines sehligen Herrn Antecessoris Matrimonii Daniel Schlaggens.'']
2 CONT ===1690s===
2 CONT *[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/A0054236_00051#?c=&m=&s=&cv=50&xywh=1183%2C90%2C4917%2C2755 06.09.1690] - He was not in active military service any more. There are no muster rolls for Estniska Adelsfana available before 1
2 CONC 690.
2 CONT *[https://ais.ra.ee/index.php?module=202&op=4&tyyp=2&otsing_id=20230201113103825258&kokku=21&id=200705638265 16.07.1698] - 50 Berend Johann Üxkülli lesk Anna Magdalena Scheiding rittmeister Frantz Strassburgi lese ja Hans Drenteln
2 CONC i vastu nõudega tagastada tema renditalupojale Körze Johanile tema vara
2 CONT ===1700s===
