2 CONT * '''Jöns Carlsson (Svinhufvud)'''  Pedigree chart born 1622 in Steneby/P. died 1659-06-27 in Bromshöög Zeeland, Copenhagen/Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Brita Carlsdotter (Svinhufvud)''' Pedigree chart born 1623 in Ärtemark/P. died 1700. Of the noble family Svinhufvud in Västergötland. Rick Gården Furnäs in Ärtemark by modern Margareta Svenskt.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Anna Carlsdotter (Svinhufvud)''' Pedigree chart born 1624 in Steneby/P.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Margareta Carlsdotter  (Svinhufvud)''' Pedigree chart born 1626 in Steneby/P. died about 1720.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Carl Carlsson (Svinhufvud)''' Pedigree Chart born 1627 in Steneby/P, buried about 1676. Captain.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Christina Carlsdotter (Svinhufvud)''' Pedigree chart born 1628 in Steneby/P.
2 CONT
