1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Major Jöns Carlsson Svinhufvud till Stora Dingelvik=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Major Carl Jönsson Svinhufvud i Västergötland and Margareta Svenske 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003897396773?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000190940006922 '''Jöns Carlsson Svinhufvud was a Major in 1645''']
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396773&photo_id=6000000116576666831&position=3 '''SVINHUFVUD I WESTERGÖTHLAND, Swedish Nobility's Tables / Section 4. Shooting of Duderhoff - Östner, Tab 1
2 CONC 5.''']
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396773&photo_id=6000000190256646868&position=0 '''RIKSDAGSPROTOKOLL, page 151''']
2 CONT * Born 1622 in Steneby/P. Sweden died 1659-06-27 in Bromshöög Zeeland, Copenhagen/Denmark.
2 CONT * Father: Carl was born in 1585, in Steneby Steneby Sweden and his Mother: Margaret was born in 1600, in Hestra, Vastra Gotaland, Sweden. Jöns had 7 siblings: Christina Roos Av Hjälmsäter (born Carlsdotter Svinhufvud), Carl Carlss
2 CONC on Svinhufvud, Brita Carlsdotter Svinhufvud, Johan Carlsson Svinhufvud, Margateta Biörn (born CarlsdotterSvinhufvud) and 2 other siblings.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396773&photo_id=6000000181170735956&position=1 '''Gyllensvärd nr. 240''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396773&photo_id=6000000116576666831&position=5 '''BEATA Persdotter Gyllensvärd'''] on December 13,1646 in Åsundenleden Sweden.  BEATA was born in 
2 CONC 1622, in Bolmsö, Kronobergs län. Jöns passed away on June 27 1659, at age 37 in Bromshög, Själland. Beata . Lived widow in 1698. Married to the major Jöns Svinhufvud in Västergötland, no. 199, died 1698 in Steneby (P), Jöns» Karls
2 CONC son-Svinhuvud (AF Västergötland).  Tavla1 born 1622 in Steneby (P). Died 1659-06-27 in Copenhagen, Denmark.
2 CONT * Source: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396773&photo_id=6000000204156302859&position=0 '''Värmlands regementes (Närkes och Värmlands regementes) historia, Volumes 1-2 By Carl Otto Nordens
2 CONC van.''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT *  '''Elizabeth Jonsdotter Svinhufvud,''' born in 1647 in Röksberg, Mulseryd förs, Jönköpings län (F), Sverige (Sweden)
2 CONT * '''Johan Magnus Jönsson-Svinhuvud (af Västergötland),''' born on 11 April 1649 in Röksberg, Mulseryd förs, Jönköpings län (F), Sverige (Sweden) & died on 1682 i Mulseryd (F) Sweden.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897396711&photo_id=6000000089040702855&position=1 '''Maria Catharina Jonsdotter Svinhufvud'''] born on April 11, 1649 inSolberga in Mo härad, Mulseryd förs, J
2 CONC önköpings län (F), Sweden & died onFebruary 11, 1720 (70) in Lilla Duvhult, Femsjö, Halland, Sweden. She married Captain Johan Carl Gyntersson Rosenschantz.
2 CONT * '''Carl Jönsson Svinhufvud'''
2 CONT * '''Grace Jonsdotter Svinhufvud,''' born after June 17,1659 is apparent from the letter she sent to Per Brahe on 29 June, where she tells them her husband Jons has died on June 17, 1659 and she has given birth to a small daughter
2 CONC  and wishes Per Brahe to be her Godfather. Grace was baptized on July 3 1659. (Daughter Grace never reached adulthood)
2 CONT
