1 NAME Malin (Magdalena) Larsdotter /Sparre/ till Vargarn
2 GIVN Malin (Magdalena) Larsdotter
2 NSFX till Vargarn
2 _MARNM Sparre
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 JUL 1528
