1 NAME Anders Larsson /Crantzberg/
2 GIVN Anders Larsson
2 SURN Crantzberg
2 _MARNM Crantzberg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1623
2 PLAC Aranäs gård
