1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ludmilla Jankovská von Lazan wife of Baron Jindřich Jankovský z Vlašimi of Château Rešice in Moravia. Daughter of  Jana Jiøího a Judith Bechinie z Lažan
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: Carolus Wenzeslaus Jankoffsky Swedish history
2 CONT
2 CONT Prince Karl Gustav (Karl Gustav von Pfalz-Zweibrücken) and Baroness Ludmilla (Ludmilla Bechyňové z Lažan) meet each other during Karl Gustav's participation in The Thirty Year War in Moravia. They had an affair at Château Tovačově
2 CONC  and Horní Moštěnici in 1643. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludmila gave birth to son Karl Vaclav (Carolus Wenzeslaus) in Znojmo, Moravia in 1644. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After the Battle of Jankov in 1645, Prince Karl Gustav brought Karl Vaclav back with him to Sweden. Prince Karl Gustav paid for his education and the young Karl lived with his father on the Isle of Öland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1649 the widow Ludmila needing financial aid sent a letter to Prince Karl Gustav in Sweden asking for support for herself and her two daughters Elisabeth and Maximiliana Dorothea Jankovská z Vlašimi (Sweden, a letter, dated Apr
2 CONC il 19th, 1649). 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1653 Ludmila along with Jindrich's brother Vilem made unsuccessful claim for the Bitov Estates.
2 CONT
2 CONT Prior to becoming King of Sweden in 1654 Karl Gustav returned young Karl Vaclav to his mother Ludmila in Moravia. 
2 CONT
2 CONT After Ludmila's death in 1655 Karl X Gustav, King of Sweden, intervened in King's Tribunal in support of Karl Vaclav (Instructions Royal Tribunal in Brno dated January 12th,1656).  Karl Vaclav was granted Coat of Arms, the title B
2 CONC aron Jankovský z Vlašimi and the ownership of the Rešice estate.
2 CONT
2 CONT References: 
2 CONT
2 CONT E. Knesl 1988, Historie Jankovsko – Tunklovský 1693, p79-100
2 CONT
2 CONT Pravoslav Kneidl, 1984, Historie o synu švédského krále a české paní
2 CONT
2 CONT Sixtus Bolom, 2008, Tajemství Jankovských z Vlašimi a na Bítově, Chapter 6.
2 CONT
2 CONT Fryderyk I Heski, Dynastia Palatynow, Karol X Gustaw, p173-176
2 CONT
