1 NOTE {geni:about_me} = Duchess Sabine von Württemberg=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Christoph, Duke of Württemberg and Anna Maria von Brandenburg-Ansbach
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sabine von Württemberg was born on 2 July 1549 at Montbéliard.1 She was the daughter of Christoph Herzog von Württemberg and Anna Maria von Hohenzollern. She married Wilhelm IV Landgraf von Hessen-Kassel, son of Philip I Landgraf 
2 CONC von Hessen and Christina von Sachsen, on 12 February 1566.2 She died on 17 August 1581 at age 32 at Rotenburg an der Fulda, GermanyG.1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children of Sabine von Württemberg and Wilhelm IV Landgraf von Hessen-Kassel'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Anna Maria Landgräfin von Hessen-Kassel''' +1 b. 27 Jan 1567, d. 21 Nov 1626, married in 1589 Count Louis II of Nassau-Saarbrücken (1565–1627)
2 CONT * '''Moritz Landgraf von Hessen-Kassel''' + b. 25 May 1572, d. 15 Mar 1632, married firstly, in 1593 Countess Agnes of Solms-Laubach (1578–1602), married secondly, in 1603 Countess Juliane of Nassau-Siegen (1587–1643)
2 CONT * '''Christina von Hessen-Kassel''' b. 19 Oct 1578, d. 19 Aug 1658, married in 1598 Duke John Ernest II of Saxe-Eisenach (1566–1638)
