2 CONT                    11
2 CONT
2 CONT '''26 March 1618: Extract decree arbitral between John, Earl of Mar, Treasurer of Scotland, Marie Stewart, Countess of Mar, his spouse, and John Murray of Polmais [Polmaise], nephew and heir of deceased James Murray, on one part, 
2 CONC and James, Lord Torphichen, son and heir of deceased James, Lord Torphichen, his father, and heir of deceased James, Lord Torphichen, his grand-uncle, Sir Archibald Douglas of Spot [Spott], Kt, Sir James Sandelands [Sandilands] of
2 CONC  Slamanno [Slamannan], Kt, Robert Heriot [Herriot], yr, of Trabroun, and Robert Grahame [Graham] of Thornik, finding 'inter alia' that deceased Dame Janet Murray was lawfully infeft in the lands of Halbarnis, Todishauch, Auldlisto
2 CONC un, Halyardis and Lochcoittis, sheriffdom of Edinburgh. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD124%2f1%2f1159&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=heriot&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1551&dt=1620&di=n National Re
2 CONC cords of Scotland, Papers of the Erskine Family, Earls of Mar and Kellie, reference GD124/1/1159]'''
2 CONT
