1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=palmspringsbum&id=I8331
2 CONT
2 CONT Name: Margaret Cockburn Given Name: Margaret Surname: Cockburn Sex: F Death: Y
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:
2 CONT
2 CONT (Research):The House of Cockburn and Cockburn Family Records are the only sources found thus far for the parents of this Margaret Cockburn. The latter purports to correct the errors of the former.
2 CONT
2 CONT The House of Cockburn on page 71 shows this Margaret to be the daughter of Patrick Cockburn of East Borthwick and Elizabeth, daughter of Patrick Home of Renton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Cockburn Family Records on page 73 shows a Margaret (no dates, places, children, or spouses) as daughter of Patrick Cockburn and Elizabeth Home. However, its chart of the Cockburns of East Borthwick, on the previous page, does not
2 CONC  show a Margaret as a daughter of this couple, and it shows a son, Adam, that is not mentioned in the text, listing their children as: Patrick, Adam, William, Jeane, Elizabeth, and Agnes.
2 CONT
2 CONT This Margaret does appear on the chart of the Cockburns of Clerkington, and in the text on page 166, as the daughter of John Cockburn of Clerkington and Helen Maitland of Lethington, and names her two husbands.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: John Cockburn b: Bef 1560 Mother: Helen Maitland
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Alexander Home   Married: 1601
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT #     Has Children John Home
2 CONT #     Has No Children Patrick Home
2 CONT #     Has No Children George Home
2 CONT #     Has No Children Alexander Home
2 CONT #     Has No Children Margaret Home
2 CONT #     Has No Children Jonet Home
2 CONT #     Has No Children Anne Home
2 CONT #     Has No Children Elspeth Home
2 CONT #     Has No Children Helen Home
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 2 William Graham Married: Bef 11 May 1624
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 3 Andrew Fletcher  Married:
2 CONT
